  "body": "Thoughtfully designed for modern family life, this brand-new home offers four bedrooms, a dedicated study and two living areas — giving everyone space to work, relax and spend time together.\r\n\r\nThe standout feature is the impressive high ceiling in the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating an airy, welcoming space. Step out onto the deck for a morning coffee, summer dining or an evening with friends.\r\n\r\nA separate family lounge near the entrance provides a second space to unwind, while the dedicated study makes working from home easy. All four bedrooms are upstairs, keeping sleeping spaces separate from everyday living. The master features a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, complemented by a family bathroom with a bathtub and separate shower.\r\n\r\nFeatures you’ll love:\r\n• Four upstairs bedrooms, including a master with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n• Two bathrooms plus a convenient downstairs guest toilet\r\n• Dedicated study for working from home\r\n• Open-plan living with an impressive 3.6m ceiling\r\n• Separate family lounge near the entrance\r\n• Deck for outdoor dining and entertaining\r\n• Central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n• Internal-access garage and additional parking in the generous front area\r\n• A desirable north–south orientation\r\n\r\nConveniently positioned for Silverdale’s shopping, local schools, motorway connections and the beautiful Hibiscus Coast beaches.\r\n\r\nOur motivated vendor wants this home sold. Contact us today for a private viewing, or join us at an open home.\r\n\r\nVisit our showhome at 25 Tack Road, Silverdale.",
